  "visible_text": "若 k 為一常數使得 x^{3}+4x^{2}+kx-12 被 x+3 整除，則 k = ? (A) -25, (B) -1, (C) 1, (D) 17",
  "answer": "B",
  "reasoning": "If a polynomial P(x) is divisible by (x + 3), then by the Factor Theorem P(-3) = 0. Compute P(-3) = (-3)^3 + 4(-3)^2 + k(-3) - 12 = -27 + 36 - 3k - 12 = -3 - 3k. Setting this equal to 0 gives -3 - 3k = 0 → -3k = 3 → k = -1. This matches option B."
}
